  "totalBlocks": 114,
  "translatedBlocks": 113,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "80f921dc9023261e",
      "translationZh": "人工智能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "03235c4f1dd9453e",
      "translationZh": "在 Amazon EC2 上使用 NVIDIA MPS，将 ASR 推理成本降低 75%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2e740490602bc0f",
      "translationZh": "本文由 AWS、NVIDIA 和 Heidi 合作撰写。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ba84fd00380f3c7a",
      "translationZh": "当每个请求的 GPU 利用率较低，但延迟要求严格时，降低 Amazon Elastic Compute Cloud (Amazon EC2) 上的自动语音识别（ASR）推理成本就变得至关重要。单个 ASR 推理请求通常只使用 GPU 计算能力的 15–20%，但 NVIDIA CUDA® 默认的时间切片行为会强制串行访问，使 80% 的硬件资源处于闲置状态。Heidi Health 是一个 AI 医疗伙伴，每周在 190 个国家处理超过 240 万次临床问诊。为了在流量高峰期保持亚秒级转录延迟，这种低效率迫使该公司运行 16 个 GPU 实例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "231a615cd5f48386",
      "translationZh": "在之前的一篇文章中，你了解了如何微调 Nemotron 语音模型 NVIDIA Parakeet TDT 0.6B V2，用于临床语音识别。在本文中，我们关注微调之后的环节：高效地部署该模型并提供推理服务。我们展示了如何在 Amazon EC2 GPU 实例上，将 NVIDIA CUDA Multi-Process Service (MPS) 与 NVIDIA Triton Inference Server™ 结合使用，把 GPU 基础设施需求降低 75%（从 16 个实例减少到 4 个）。在每个 GPU 每秒处理 92.1 个请求（RPS）的情况下，这一配置仍能保持亚秒级延迟。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "076b876ca7e8d32a",
      "translationZh": "本节涵盖以下内容：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "880e879009a1afc2",
      "translationZh": "GPU 利用率方面的挑战。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ecc7271f15dd85b3",
      "translationZh": "三种可用的共享机制。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7306508b0ed46c84",
      "translationZh": "使用 ONNX 和 TensorRT™ 进行模型级优化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "db090c1496cce8d6",
      "translationZh": "使用 Triton 进行请求调度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8bf423774704e0a4",
      "translationZh": "这些组件如何在 Amazon EC2 上集成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "816c19ef11bf41f4",
      "translationZh": "GPU 利用率问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c6cd3b374323812",
      "translationZh": "在 Parakeet TDT 0.6B V2 模型上，单个 ASR 推理请求大约只使用 NVIDIA L40S GPU 的 142 个流式多处理器（SMs）的 15–20%。其余 80% 在每次前向传播期间都处于空闲状态。CUDA 默认的时间片轮转行为让每个进程独占 GPU，进一步加剧了这种浪费。各进程轮流执行，进程之间的上下文切换会增加开销，而且不会发生并发执行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "014e7fd3f9c407f3",
      "translationZh": "结果是：在可接受的延迟下（平均值 < 650 ms，p99 < 1,000 ms），单个 GPU 只能处理约 62 RPS。因此，Heidi 当前的生产部署需要 16 个 GPU 来应对峰值流量，并为满足延迟服务级别协议（SLAs）留出足够余量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0af35720c7f1a4b2",
      "translationZh": "为解决这一利用率缺口，我们评估了 NVIDIA 硬件上可用的三种 GPU 共享机制，每种机制在隔离性、并发性和运维复杂度之间都有不同的权衡。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2abff091b2c12148",
      "translationZh": "下图对比了默认的 GPU 时间片轮转行为与 CUDA MPS 并发执行，展示了 MPS 如何消除闲置的 SM 容量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a9598052e988445",
      "translationZh": "图 1：GPU 时间切片与 CUDA MPS 对比。左：默认的时间切片方式，每个请求仅使用约 20% 的 SM，约 80% 处于空闲状态，并存在上下文切换开销，需要 16 个 GPU。右：CUDA MPS 将 GPU 划分为 4 个并发实例，每个实例分配 25% 的 SM，仅用 4 个 GPU 即可达到 92.1 RPS（GPU 数量减少 75%）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8307bb87531f55e9",
      "translationZh": "理解 GPU 共享：时间切片、MIG 和 MPS",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e0eb1151d158d7b3",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA GPU 提供三种多租户共享机制，每种机制都有不同的权衡：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "20ed58d271ca0e69",
      "translationZh": "MIG（多实例 GPU）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86d477c0ad407c26",
      "translationZh": "MPS（多进程服务）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc46fd852cee0d6f",
      "translationZh": "共享上下文，SM 软限制",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fd5742782a6fde99",
      "translationZh": "是——支持并发内核",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7796f9d82cc70634",
      "translationZh": "在一个 GPU 上运行多个小模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34305114c8bf5318",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA CUDA MPS 是 CUDA API 的一种二进制兼容替代实现。它允许多个进程并发共享一个 GPU，无需修改代码。与时间片轮转（进程轮流访问）或 Multi-Instance GPU（MIG，通过专用内存控制器创建严格的物理分区）不同，MPS 将所有 CUDA 工作汇集到由 MPS 守护进程管理的单个 GPU 上下文中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7385fc3a55bab29a",
      "translationZh": "对于我们的工作负载，主要优势包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4b26352110473cb9",
      "translationZh": "消除上下文切换开销：所有进程共享同一组 GPU 调度资源。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "de5be44df0e85dd0",
      "translationZh": "支持并发内核执行，不同进程的内核可在不同的 SM 上同时运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ddcf07f83fdb0eee",
      "translationZh": "可通过 CUDA_MPS_ACTIVE_THREAD_PERCENTAGE 环境变量配置分区大小。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1067e2c985f43cb1",
      "translationZh": "无需修改代码即可使用。现有 CUDA 应用程序无需改动即可运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "42d8b2d0be80ee9c",
      "translationZh": "通过独立地址空间实现客户端之间的内存保护。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bbe0a9bb3547f2c9",
      "translationZh": "对于此工作负载，在专用 GPU 实例上部署两套独立的 MPS 配置。转录实例使用 25% 的 SM 分配比例，并发运行四个进程（每个进程使用 48 GB VRAM 中的约 2.5 GB）。说话人分离实例使用 12% 的 SM，并发运行八个进程（每个进程约使用 1.8 GB）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da12356c7a8ce238",
      "translationZh": "虽然 MPS 解决了 GPU 利用率问题，但我们还可以通过模型级优化进一步缩短每个请求的计算时间。我们优化栈中的下一层会将模型中计算密集的编码器转换为针对硬件优化的格式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fa12e51a757f05ea",
      "translationZh": "结合 TensorRT 的 ONNX Runtime",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ccd799398821b15a",
      "translationZh": "ONNX Runtime 是一个高性能推理引擎，使用针对特定硬件的执行提供程序（Execution Providers）运行开放神经网络交换（Open Neural Network Exchange，ONNX）模型。TensorRT Execution Provider 将 ONNX 图节点路由至 NVIDIA TensorRT，后者通过内核融合、精度校准（FP16/INT8）和内存优化，生成针对硬件调优的引擎。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "32fad266fa4122ed",
      "translationZh": "对于我们的工作负载，该流水线采用混合方案。计算密集的 Conformer 编码器（24 层、1024 个隐藏维度）通过配备 TensorRT EP 的 ONNX Runtime 运行，受益于算子融合和 FP16 精度校准。RNN-T Token-and-Duration Transducer（TDT，词元与时长转导器）解码器则在 PyTorch CUDA 中原生运行，因为借助 CUDA 图缓存进行变长词元生成，比使用静态 TensorRT 引擎更灵活。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f82ccf8adeaf7e8c",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA Triton Inference Server 负责生产环境推理的请求调度和批处理。该流水线采用两种批处理策略：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "405cd348f772dd8f",
      "translationZh": "动态批处理（转写）：在可配置的延迟时间（50 ms）内累积请求，然后将其作为一个批次派发。首选批次大小 [4, 8, 16] 使调度器能够形成最优分组。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2035278b16757194",
      "translationZh": "序列批处理（说话人分离）：在服务端维护每段录音的流式处理状态。每个客户端发送带有关联 ID 的 15 秒音频块，Triton 将它们路由至正确的模型实例。会话在无活动 600 秒后自动过期（max_idle_timeout）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "be1056ed2c06dcca",
      "translationZh": "每个 Triton 模型实例都映射到一个 MPS 分区，从而实现批处理调度器与 GPU 分区层之间的自然集成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "be64a13cd1ecb6a1",
      "translationZh": "这三项技术共同构成了 Amazon EC2 上的统一推理流水线，下一节将对此进行介绍。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9c0cde5a1faaf28b",
      "translationZh": "推理流水线架构",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b79701e169714436",
      "translationZh": "推理流水线运行在 Amazon EC2 g6e.4xlarge 和 g7e.4xlarge 实例（NVIDIA L40S，48 GB）上，包含三个通过 Docker Compose 编排的容器化组件：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84f8fbb8e84b563d",
      "translationZh": "下图展示了部署在单个 Amazon EC2 GPU 实例上的三层推理架构。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "285d0b9e7b08ad2d",
      "translationZh": "图 2：Amazon EC2 上的解决方案架构。FastAPI 网关对音频进行解码，并通过 gRPC 将请求路由到 Triton Inference Server，后者将请求分发到采用 MPS 分区的各个模型实例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "383c42056bab0a78",
      "translationZh": "FastAPI 网关：兼容 OpenAI Whisper 的 REST API，将上传的音频解码为原始的 16 kHz 单声道 float32 张量，然后通过 gRPC 转发到 Triton。在端口 8002 上运行 4 个 uvicorn 工作进程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da7524590fce4942",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA Triton Inference Server：管理用于转录的动态批处理（首选批大小为 [4, 8, 16]，max_queue_delay_microseconds: 50000），以及用于流式说话人分离的序列批处理。将请求分发到各个模型实例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e474fd73de123ef3",
      "translationZh": "CUDA MPS 守护进程：在推理服务器启动之前，于 Triton 容器内启动。将 GPU 划分为可并发运行的执行上下文（用于转录时为四个实例，每个实例占用 25% 的 SM；用于说话人分离时为八个实例，每个实例占用 12% 的 SM）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "959a92c1280f3f66",
      "translationZh": "配套的 AWS 服务：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7dfc694c973ef294",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Elastic Container Registry (Amazon ECR)：存储 Triton 和网关的容器镜像（以 nvcr.io/nvidia/tritonserver:26.03-py3 为基础镜像）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "317c3aac04d53790",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Elastic Block Store (Amazon EBS)：存储模型检查点、TensorRT 引擎缓存和 ONNX 导出文件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e52ded8240d5ddff",
      "translationZh": "Amazon CloudWatch：用于 Prometheus 指标摄取、日志聚合以及 p50/p90/p95/p99 延迟仪表板。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d1cd5943ec429caa",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Simple Storage Service (Amazon S3)：用于模型产物归档和检查点存储。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ddf55e55b42ea546",
      "translationZh": "以下先决条件适用于随附的代码仓库。满足这些条件后，即可按照后续章节中的部署步骤操作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "94af80915a73b957",
      "translationZh": "一个能够访问 Amazon EC2 g6e.4xlarge 或 g7e.4xlarge 实例（NVIDIA L40S，48 GB）的 AWS 账户。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "17a8b44f7f3f93da",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA 驱动程序 535+，配合 CUDA 12.x。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9c17dc51e877ca86",
      "translationZh": "Docker，配合 NVIDIA Container Toolkit。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d4a39f48fc552b46",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA Triton Inference Server 容器（nvcr.io/nvidia/tritonserver:26.03-py3）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bff5dfcbad745629",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA NeMo™ Toolkit 2.7+ 和一个 Parakeet TDT 0.6B V2 模型检查点（.nemo 格式）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3884b98168bb8cb8",
      "translationZh": "用于音频解码的 torchcodec（pip install torchcodec）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f9a2f8e919021275",
      "translationZh": "用于网关与 Triton 之间通信的 tritonclient[grpc]。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "252b24f997cc889f",
      "translationZh": "关键实现细节",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "75364cb67aba4751",
      "translationZh": "本文配套的开源代码仓库提供了完整实现。以下各节将逐步介绍部署、配置，以及在 CUDA MPS 下实现稳定运行所依据的关键设计决策。该仓库包含构建和部署推理流水线所需的全部内容：Dockerfiles、Triton 模型后端、FastAPI 网关和编排配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "75edf6978b202080",
      "translationZh": "克隆配套代码仓库，然后使用三条命令完成部署：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96d2e6c2705a3bcb",
      "translationZh": "容器会自动处理 MPS 守护进程的启动、模型加载和健康监控。当 /health 返回 200 时，服务便已就绪（通常在启动后 90-120 秒）。完整的快速入门指南请参阅代码仓库的 README。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "67f2f1afe25bda06",
      "translationZh": "探索代码仓库",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e9ea66b8395f35e8",
      "translationZh": "代码仓库支持两种部署模式：单个一体化容器（Dockerfile.single），或通过 Docker Compose 拆分为两个容器，以便独立扩缩 GPU 推理层和 CPU 网关层。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e94b27d8fa8d1397",
      "translationZh": "构建并运行容器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1dff13a2672a9ad0",
      "translationZh": "将微调后的 .nemo 检查点作为构建参数来构建容器镜像，然后按所需的 MPS 实例数量运行。Dockerfile 会将检查点嵌入镜像，并在构建步骤中应用局部注意力优化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "094d21c009519eed",
      "translationZh": "容器的启动顺序为：(1) 启动 CUDA MPS 守护进程，(2) 运行 auto_config.py 以设置 Triton 实例数量和 SM 百分比，(3) 启动 tritonserver。完整的构建和运行说明请参阅代码仓库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "47beaa556fd75ab6",
      "translationZh": "配置部署",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9cf41cd9d8095a76",
      "translationZh": "环境变量（MPS_INSTANCE_COUNT、GATEWAY_WORKERS、TRITON_URL、CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES）控制所有运行时行为。通过修改 MPS_INSTANCE_COUNT，同一个容器镜像即可适用于不同类型的 GPU；该变量同时设置 Triton 实例组中的实例数量和每个实例的 SM 百分比。完整的配置参考请参阅代码仓库中的 README。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a4b077f21ebe6d2a",
      "translationZh": "理解关键设计决策",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d9ec98bdf790ccab",
      "translationZh": "该实现做出了几项重要的设计选择，它们对于在 CUDA MPS 下稳定运行至关重要。本节重点介绍其中最重要的几项。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "80e091146cac8b79",
      "translationZh": "直接前向传播。Triton 后端直接调用 model.forward()，而不是通过 NeMo 调用 model.transcribe()，从而为每个请求消除约 50 ms 的框架开销。结合 bfloat16 自动类型转换和每个实例专用的 CUDA 流，单个实例处理 45 秒音频约需 160 ms。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7e2a28071073de16",
      "translationZh": "串行化模型加载。四个进程同时加载一个 600M 参数的模型会超出 GPU 内存容量。后端使用文件锁（fcntl.flock）将初始化串行化，每个实例在释放锁之前依次完成加载、迁移到 GPU、冻结权重以及 CUDA 图预热。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c654da6b45ac5978",
      "translationZh": "CUDA 图预热覆盖范围。TDT 解码器使用 CUDA 图来消除内核启动开销。在初始化期间，后端会对所有预期的生产环境形状进行预热（批大小为 1 时的 5、15、30、45 和 60 秒，以及批大小为 2 时的 61 秒）。此覆盖范围内的形状会重放缓存的图，耗时约 165 ms。超出此范围的形状仅在该次调用中回退到即时执行（约 500 ms）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9c176d4abca4d2aa",
      "translationZh": "MPS 安全的 CUDA 图回退。在 MPS 下，当 NeMo 的解码器遇到新的张量形状时，它会尝试重新捕获 CUDA 图。在 1.5–2.5 秒的重新捕获窗口期间，其他 MPS 实例会破坏捕获过程，导致 cudaErrorIllegalAddress 并使进程崩溃。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f4a6480f6b559cd",
      "translationZh": "卡死哨兵健康监控。在持续负载下，一个 MPS 实例中的 CUDA 错误可能使该实例无法恢复。当后端检测到卡死的实例时（通过 CUDA 流探测失败），它会向 tmpfs 写入一个哨兵文件（/tmp/parakeet_wedged）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e027cf8983c60575",
      "translationZh": "动态批处理。Triton 会累积请求，批大小最多为 16（优选大小为 4、8、16），最大排队延迟为 50 ms，以平衡延迟与吞吐量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5f978d5fe7af1c2a",
      "translationZh": "网关侧音频解码。FastAPI 网关使用 torchcodec 处理音频解码（WAV、WebM/Opus、MP3、M4A、FLAC），使 Triton 的输入保持为原始 float32 张量，从而让网关能够在仅配备 CPU 的节点上运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "15c9097d831e55d5",
      "translationZh": "流式说话人分离",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "22d2800a3b5288c1",
      "translationZh": "说话人分离模型（NVIDIA Streaming Sortformer 4-speaker v2）使用八个 MPS 实例，每个实例分配 12% 的 SM，并通过序列批处理维护每段录音的状态。每段录音都会获得一个唯一的关联 ID，用于音频块路由，会话在 600 秒后自动过期。该模型以 TensorRT + ONNX 引擎形式运行，并在容器启动时进行预热优化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc944ebaf0eaee85",
      "translationZh": "网关提供兼容 OpenAI Whisper 的 API（POST /v1/audio/transcriptions），可直接替换现有集成中的对应服务。其他端点包括 /health（存活检查 + 卡死哨兵检查）和 /metrics（Prometheus 格式的延迟分位数）。响应格式包括 json、verbose_json、text、srt 和 vtt。完整的 API 参考请参阅代码仓库。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ba5c8ee3985db8f2",
      "translationZh": "基准测试针对每种配置，将并发数从 1 遍历到 100，并对 5 轮测量结果取平均值。音频样本为具有代表性的临床问诊片段。SLA 阈值为：平均延迟 < 650 ms 且 p99 < 1,000 ms。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3cac15a31b26b1a6",
      "translationZh": "配置 1：Triton + MPS（g6e.4xlarge）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e700e10bf1beab3b",
      "translationZh": "⬅ 最优运行点——满足平均延迟 < 650 ms 且 p99 < 1,000 ms 的最高并发数。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b4132ccf590525a",
      "translationZh": "结果：建议使用 4 个 GPU（相比目前的 16 个），减少 75%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9d995349cb24a474",
      "translationZh": "配置 2：Triton + MPS（g7e.4xlarge）——选定的生产方案",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "55b226da240313a9",
      "translationZh": "相比 g6e，g7e 在最佳运行点的吞吐量超过 51%，延迟低于 25%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "14798be053060397",
      "translationZh": "配置 3：TensorRT + ONNX + MPS",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "23fd8206aa459779",
      "translationZh": "结果：建议使用 2 个 GPU（相比目前的 16 个），减少 88%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c97922cb8e2858b5",
      "translationZh": "配置比较",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52bb6be867a34173",
      "translationZh": "下图比较了所有配置的吞吐量扩展情况。请关注每条曲线进入 SLA 违约区域（虚线区域）的点，该点决定了每种配置可持续维持的最大并发量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1084250f4b456348",
      "translationZh": "图 3：所有配置的吞吐量随并发量增长的变化。虚线区域表示 SLA 违约（平均延迟 > 650 ms 或 p99 > 1,000 ms）。选定的生产方案（在 g7e 上运行 Triton + MPS）实现了每个 GPU 92.1 RPS，并节省了 75% 的基础设施成本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3dbaaa78ed9b7f9e",
      "translationZh": "我们对 TensorRT 引擎预热优化前后的说话人分离模型进行了基准测试：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ad5ca8047b79e1f",
      "translationZh": "预热优化还将标准差从 12.62 ms 降至 7.13 ms（降幅不到 44%），表明推理延迟的可预测性显著提高。该模型将 60 秒的录音分为四个各 15 秒的分块进行处理，所有分块的处理耗时都远在整体流水线的时间预算之内。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d88450b9a3e2aa18",
      "translationZh": "在实际运行中，说话人分离将一次 60 秒的问诊分为四个各 15 秒的分块进行处理，每个分块的平均延迟为 238 ms（总耗时不到 1 秒，实时因子为 0.016x）。八个说话人分离实例在与转写任务分开的独立 MPS 分区上运行，不存在资源争用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cd4e58d896431d27",
      "translationZh": "为避免测试后持续产生费用，请清理你按照本文操作时创建的资源：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ac73f8630734ec6e",
      "translationZh": "停止并终止 Amazon EC2 GPU 实例（g6e.4xlarge 或 g7e.4xlarge）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "da8a37e4b2b27b3f",
      "translationZh": "删除已挂载的 Amazon EBS 卷（模型检查点、TensorRT 缓存）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "14bdd141141a5a77",
      "translationZh": "如果已推送 Docker 镜像，请将其从 Amazon ECR 中移除。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4852ae0b9f27ff1a",
      "translationZh": "删除测试期间创建的所有 Amazon CloudWatch 日志组。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9176681984f1cb46",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，我们展示了如何利用 Amazon EC2 上的 NVIDIA CUDA MPS，将 ASR 推理基础设施规模减少 75%（从 16 个 GPU 减至 4 个），同时满足亚秒级延迟 SLA（平均延迟 < 650 ms，p99 < 1,000 ms）。在 g7e.4xlarge 上，MPS 实现了每个 GPU 92.1 RPS，平均延迟为 352 ms。对于能够接受在每轮微调后重新导出 ONNX 的工作负载，TensorRT + ONNX + MPS 优化可进一步达到 111.6 RPS（基础设施规模减少 88%）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c7d6df178c788567",
      "translationZh": "这些优化与模型无关：MPS 架构、直接前向传播模式、CUDA 图安全机制和卡死哨兵机制，适用于任何通过 Triton 在 NVIDIA GPU 上提供服务的编码器—解码器模型。同样的方法已通过 NVIDIA Canary 和 OpenAI Whisper large-v3 检查点验证。该模式可扩展到任何单个请求仅使用可用 GPU 算力一小部分的工作负载。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2adf182321b47516",
      "translationZh": "对于生产部署，先在 g7e.4xlarge 上启动四个 MPS 实例，并使用 nvidia-smi 监控 GPU SM 利用率。如果 p99 延迟还有余量，可逐步增加 MPS_INSTANCE_COUNT。TensorRT + ONNX + MPS 路径可额外带来 21% 的吞吐量提升（111.6 RPS，相比之下原先为 92.1 RPS）。代价是部署流水线更长，并且需要每周重新导出 ONNX。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c40e1222a45967cb",
      "translationZh": "配套的 GitHub 仓库包含完整实现：Dockerfiles、Triton 模型配置、FastAPI 网关、CUDA 图安全补丁、健康监控以及基准测试脚本，可直接部署到任何 EC2 GPU 实例上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "paragraph",
